  "version": 1,
  "description": "Routing index for the mrrc_hub SDD knowledge layer. Maps engineering areas (by file globs and keywords) to typed SDD references. Contains NO duplicated content — sdd_context.py resolves refs by slicing the live SDD/*.md files, so the harness can never drift stale from the design record. Ref grammar: ad:AD-Hxx | nfr:NFR-Hxxx | uc:UC-Hxx | risk:R-Hx | issue:I-Hx | assume:A-Hx | sc:SC-Hx | sec:N.N (chapter section) | ch:NN (whole chapter, manual use). Engine-fixed chapter mapping: ad→8, uc→6, nfr→5, risk/issue/assume→13, sc→3.",
